Honor disable_lockdown in the WaitingForPlatformConfiguration lockdown check.

A host profile that opts out of lockdown management still fell into the
disable flow here, because this arm only tested the BMC status. Emulated and
stub BMCs answer with a constant status the disable flow can never satisfy, so
SetLockdown hands off to PollingLockdownStatus, whose miss branch returns an
uncapped StateHandlerOutcome::wait and the machine never leaves HostInit.

The opt-out already suppresses every re-enable (SetLockdown for
LockdownMode::Enable, LockHost in platform config and reprovision), so gating
this arm on it keeps both halves of the flag consistent.

register.sh passes --disable-lockdown true, so every lab machine hits this.

diff --git a/crates/machine-controller/src/handler.rs b/crates/machine-controller/src/handler.rs
index af3dd59d3..cb6c4e2d6 100644
--- a/crates/machine-controller/src/handler.rs
+++ b/crates/machine-controller/src/handler.rs
@@ -7334,7 +7334,12 @@ impl StateHandler for HostMachineStateHandler {
                                 e
                             )));
                         }
-                        Ok(lockdown_status) if !lockdown_status.is_fully_disabled() => {
+                        // Honor the profile opt-out here too. An emulated BMC never reports
+                        // lockdown as disabled, so PollingLockdownStatus would wait for ever.
+                        Ok(lockdown_status)
+                            if !lockdown_status.is_fully_disabled()
+                                && !mh_snapshot.host_snapshot.host_profile.disable_lockdown =>
+                        {
                             tracing::info!(
                                 "Lockdown is enabled for {host_machine_id} during machine_setup, disabling now."
                             );
@@ -7349,7 +7354,8 @@ impl StateHandler for HostMachineStateHandler {
                             return Ok(StateHandlerOutcome::transition(next_state));
                         }
                         Ok(_) => {
-                            // Lockdown is disabled, proceed with machine_setup
+                            // Lockdown is disabled or the profile opts out of managing it,
+                            // proceed with machine_setup
                         }
                     }
 
